pl co_sort and co_sort_stable directly to Permutation\nadd doc to CoSort and CoSortStable", "created_at": "2019-02-28T13:26:48Z", "repo": "co_sort", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8a681f2781738ecce04c753f7b1ca7591b7fe667", "message": "init", "created_at": "2019-02-28T03:58:21Z", "repo": "co_sort", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "584442a236aa3fdb01fe08e0a594ea9bc283a551", "message": "chore: Release beach_map version 0.3.1", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:07:47Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42ee166861cbab1f2ab4492e0542a60cbd469021", "message": "Fix clippy", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:04:10Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39c94ca77625a1614d9347805f50b65792d84a8a", "message": "Fix retain\n\nretain swaps removed entries with the last element\nIt correctly redirected removed entries but not the last element\nThis lead to UB when accessing it after retain\n\nAdd missing test for drain\n\nFix #6", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:01:43Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "51149fb1fbc70de3f4c37801481425cee2607442", "message": "Fix drain_with_id\n\nThis method was missing the slots cleanup present in drain\nAfter calling drain_with_id any following insertion would be invalid and lead to UB when accessed\n\nAdd missing test for drain_with_id\nStrengthen drain test\n\nFix #7", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:21:08Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a39f263244daa5c81a707080b3fe1549ce46c96", "message": "Add safety comments", "created_at": "2024-06-06T20:36:55Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "28e569ed4cd91a6580d32b6ade3ec8b67ef88384", "message": "Add spawn\n\nClean up docs and add a few examples", "created_at": "2024-06-05T07:30:55Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "82bd7e1578daa84ed07a98b2c1775557325edc82", "message": "Bump version number and set edition to 2024", "created_at": "2024-06-05T07:30:16Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fc7cf8f4fa98d3bcdb93ba7dbab412bdf68139ee", "message": "Impl Clone for BeachMap", "created_at": "2024-06-01T00:09:42Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8274374ff67aa70071a1cf3045db501afaec492b", "message": "Fix Send + Sync bound for Id", "created_at": "2024-05-31T23:56:42Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e33e00850c413e775f4faaa2f9ddc5268a8c687d", "message": "Impl PartialOrd and Ord for Id", "created_at": "2024-05-29T08:50:21Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b95323167f204ac11c05be52fd9dd72e65e9ebaa", "message": "Rework most of the crate\n\nMake the handle 4 bytes instead of 12\nRemove the ability to customize the version type\nMake handles typed with an escape hatch\n\nI don't expect most people to care about the size of the version\npreviously you had to type ID<u32> everywhere which was pretty bad\nnow the type actually make sense like Id<Sword>\n\nThe number of unique elements stored at one time is significantly smaller\nbut 16M should be enough for most people and it makes BeachMap use less memory\nI could reduce the size of the generation a little more to allow more elements, it's a trade-off", "created_at": "2024-05-27T13:12:21Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "943f443a58dfb484048bcef5bbb3fe3e08de8eb2", "message": "Enable code highlighting in README", "created_at": "2021-06-24T02:40:56Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9f4516581cf3b4fd121e28ab114aab7fc98dc9ff", "message": "Swap BeachMap's generics and make V optional\n\nAdd Id::invalid to get a dummy ID", "created_at": "2021-06-24T02:38:59Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cfa6ce67b50915f86f7d61a6dcd3f54d0d9c1b2b", "message": "derive Hash for ID", "created_at": "2020-12-28T20:46:53Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "59a7ed035bceb9d0df2dfdd7e0aa4048583cc608", "message": "add (de)serialization for ID\nadd support for no_std\nbump version\nfix #4", "created_at": "2020-04-24T09:10:41Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "324d36ed0309a12e381f6c30251e0625ff84803a", "message": "get_unchecked and get_unchecked_mut take ID\ninstead of usize, users can't access ID.index", "created_at": "2019-04-01T21:24:13Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "48d28c7519fea44b637162cb8803938baef7b05f", "message": "replace empty closure by drop", "created_at": "2019-04-01T14:08:43Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e0fd5369636d1d660fa4c77df502c41ca0c0febd", "message": "add rayon section", "created_at": "2019-04-01T13:00:15Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ce81dabbe43c6c59bc7a7191efccd4196fec261e", "message": "rephrase doc", "created_at": "2019-04-01T13:00:02Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "482eab0760de31baf446d832c8ff2eeda748f080", "message": "add rayon section to the crate doc", "created_at": "2019-04-01T12:55:48Z", "repo": "beach_map", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": n